# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PUBLIC REPRODUCIBILITY EVIDENCE — INTENTIONALLY TRACKED
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Curated CSV/JSON/README files used to:
#   - reproduce and verify manuscript Tables 5–13,
#   - support appendix results,
#   - compare rerun results against manuscript values,
#   - support statistical/post-processing checks.
#
# Keep these files compact and reviewer-facing. Do not copy complete raw
# campaign folders here.

!data/reproducibility/
!data/reproducibility/**

# Processed manuscript-facing CSV summaries are intentionally tracked.
!data/processed_results/
!data/processed_results/**

# Keep this file tracked.
!.gitignore

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RAW EXPERIMENT CAMPAIGNS — NEVER TRACK
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep complete optimizer/rerun trees local only.
#
# Reviewer-facing evidence must be exported separately to:
#   data/reproducibility/
# or, where appropriate:
#   data/processed_results/
#
# Do NOT add exceptions here for:
#   - campaign manifests
#   - experiment_summary.csv / experiment_metadata.json
#   - candidates.csv
#   - run_metadata.json
#   - generation_summary.csv
#   - generation_objectives.csv
#   - runtime_profile_summary.csv
#   - generation_profile.csv
#   - bs_depth_summary.csv
#   - final_ranked_layouts_index.json
#   - generation_elites_index.json
#   - generated .npz layout archives
#
# This rule also automatically protects the final independent verification
# rerun, provided it is written anywhere below results/.
results/

# Stale composite Figure 7 outputs; manuscript-style panel files are retained.
data/reproducibility/revision_final_30seed_nofg/convergence/Figure7_convergence.pdf
data/reproducibility/revision_final_30seed_nofg/convergence/Figure7_convergence.png